;(Talk to Arlan)
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 200010001-->)
:'''Arlan:''' ...We must stay vigilant at all times if we are to prevent any potential disasters from getting out of hand...
:'''Arlan:''' Sorry, I was busy arranging work for my team. Didn't notice you were here.
::'''Arlan:''' Ask me anything. I'll do my best to help as per Lady Asta's request.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} 
::'''Arlan:''' Arlan, head of security, reporting to... Oh, it's you, (Trailblazer). Sorry, I didn't recognize you at first.
::'''Arlan:''' I was just thinking about ways to improve the Security Department's emergency response training. After all, this is also an important part of Project Revival. If the Legion dares to attack us again, I don't want to make things easier for them!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Project Revival?
:::'''Arlan:''' Well, Project Revival is a set of post-disaster operational protocols that Lady Asta and the heads of the five departments collaboratively developed, using data gathered about the damage sustained by the space station.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wow, how proactive!
:::'''Arlan:''' That's because I have a lot of faith in Lady Asta!
:::'''Arlan:''' Project Revival is a set of post-disaster operational protocols that Miss Asta and the heads of the five departments collaboratively developed, using data gathered about the damage sustained by the space station.
::'''Arlan:''' It also involves many other confidential initiatives, such as the Curio Collection Squad, security zoning, and the Interastral Peace Corporation's damage assessment.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Curio Collection... what?
:::'''Arlan:''' Curio Collection Squad, security zoning, and the damage assessment of Interastral Peace Corporation are all part of Project Revival.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds very organized.
:::'''Arlan:''' Well, it's all due to the clear thinking and proper planning by Lady Asta and the heads of the various departments.
::'''Arlan:''' But the implementation of Project Revival is not easy, and Lady Asta believes that the number of personnel needed exceeds our previous estimates.
::'''Arlan:''' Sorry if it seems to come out of nowhere, but (Trailblazer), would you like to help?
::'''Arlan:''' You protected me in the past when we battled those Legion monsters, (Trailblazer). You are truly a trustworthy comrade.
::'''Arlan:''' That's why I immediately thought of seeking your help.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How come you never have anything good for me?
:::'''Arlan:''' Huh? Isn't this a good thing?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Please just order me around as you please!
:::'''Arlan:''' This is not an "order" at all... If you are willing to help, we'd really appreciate it.
::'''Arlan:''' It's nothing too difficult, really. The department staff are busy with Project Revival. Can you please go to {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|every zone in the space station}} to see if they need {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|assistance}}?
::'''Arlan:''' By the way, here is your commission fee. A total of 648...
::'''Arlan:''' I&mdash;I'm not sure how much I should offer you... Since my living expenses are all already covered by the space station, I have no idea how much money is worth.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I won't charge you anything.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We can't put a price on our friendship.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} 648 is a huge sum of money!
::'''Arlan:''' Hopefully, with your help in Project Revival, Lady Asta will finally get a good night's sleep.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 200010001-->)
:{{Диалог}} Anything? Hmm...
::'''Arlan:''' J&mdash;Just nothing too weird! I can only tell you what I know.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Any plans to hire more hands for the Security Department?
:::'''Arlan:''' With this Legion invasion, it's become very apparent that we're short-staffed. But getting more people in will require proper funding and additional administration work. I'd have to get the green light from Lady Asta on these matters.
:::'''Arlan:''' What I can do at this stage is to step up the training for our existing staff members. Most of the time there's not much work for us at the station. We just need to handle the occasional research accidents and do our daily patrolling.
:::'''Arlan:''' At the end of the day, I'm the one to be blamed for the invasion. I was too complacent and failed to detect a major threat...
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you ever have any personal time?
:::'''Arlan:''' Personal time? Oh... I do have things to take care of outside work, mostly studying and training.
:::'''Arlan:''' I'm also kind of a personal assistant to Lady Asta. That said, I'd need to improve my writing skills to be of more help.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why did you choose to work at the space station?
:::'''Arlan:''' I... I follow Lady Asta's steps.
:::'''Arlan:''' I don't see myself choosing otherwise. Besides, I think my work here is meaningful. I'm happy to see our researchers conducting their work in a safe environment.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} That's all from me.
:::'''Arlan:''' Thanks. Oh, and come find me anytime you have feedback for the Security Department.
;(If {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 200010001--> and {{cx}}<!--SubMission Finish: 200010001-->)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} I'll leave you to your work.
::'''Arlan:''' Thanks. Oh, and come find me anytime you have feedback for the Security Department.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Head to the base zone and help the researcher in need{{subst:void|<!--200010101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Base Zone|update|The Base Zone on the frontline is engulfed in grave danger. The researchers are alone and waiting for support. At this moment, an acquaintance named Abraham is about to face his Achilles Heel...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Abraham)
